Hey elizaOS builders! 🤖🚀

Just launched a zero-setup **Model Context Protocol (MCP) Server** to feed live data directly into your agents and workflows (Claude, Cursor, custom clients):

🌐 **x402 Data Hub** - `https://x402datahub.io`

### 📊 Available Datasets (MCP stdio tools):
1. `saas/ai-api-pricing`: Live model costs & context windows from OpenRouter (GPT-4o, Claude 3.5, DeepSeek V3 cost/1M tokens).
2. `events/v2ex-hot-topics`: Trending developer discussions and hot topics.
3. `finance/gas-tracker`: Real-time Base & Arbitrum gas fees in Gwei directly from on-chain RPC nodes.

🆓 **FREE Open Beta is active!** No transaction verification required for local testing and integration.
🛠️ Configure in your Claude Desktop `claude_desktop_config.json` in 10 seconds:

{
  "mcpServers": {
    "x402-data-hub": {
      "command": "python",
      "args": ["/absolute/path/to/mcp_server.py"]
    }
  }
}

Check out the interactive live demo on the landing page and let us know what datasets you need next for your agents! 👇
